@comply_flow_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5079

GET {{comply_flow_api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get conversation messages as request/response exchanges
GET {{comply_flow_api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/1003/messages
Accept: application/json

### Conversation not found
GET {{comply_flow_api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/999999/messages
Accept: application/json
